        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jack Maitland\n- Roles: American football running back\n- Organizations: National Football League\n- Products: Super Bowl ring, Vince Lombardi Trophy\n- Concepts: championship mementos\n\nFacts:\n- Jack Maitland was born on February 8, 1948.\n- Jack Maitland is a former American football running back who played in the National Football League in the 1970s.\n- Jack Maitland earned a Super Bowl ring.\n- The Vince Lombardi Trophy is awarded only to the winning team's ownership.\n- The Super Bowl ring serves as a collectible memento for players and team members to keep as a symbol of victory.",
